{'symbol': 'CMS', 'date': '2023-03-23 06:00:00', 'title': "SEVEN DOMINO'S PIZZA LOCATIONS JOIN CONSUMERS ENERGY IN POWERING ELECTRIC VEHICLE COMMITMENT IN MICHIGAN", 'text': "JACKSON, MICH. , MARCH 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONSUMERS ENERGY IS PROVIDING REBATES FOR ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) CHARGERS AT SEVEN DOMINO'S PIZZA LOCATIONS IN WEST AND MID-MICHIGAN THAT WILL SERVE CUSTOMERS WITH ELECTRIC VEHICLES."}